    "body": "Should this also set `<var>focus target</var>` to the shadow root if the shadow root has delegatesfocus in order to have the same behavior? In order to match this line from \"focus delegate:\r\n\r\n> If whereToLook is a shadow host , then set whereToLook to whereToLook 's shadow root .\r\n\r\nI don't think that the current tests actually account for this, I am working on a new one. I don't have strong opinions on what the behavior should really be yet.",
