    "body": "So I'm not convinced that looking across shadow boundaries for autofocus makes sense, shouldn't you require `autofocus` on the host as well? Otherwise it feels weird that something that might look innocuous like:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<custom-button>Something</custom-button>\r\n```\r\n\r\nWould steal the focus, if it doesn't have `autofocus` set...",
