    "body": "Yeah now that I think about it more, maybe we really don't need to add this behavior to get autofocus delegate since it should only make a difference when the popover is a shadow host, and I don't know if we really intended to make that a supported use case for this autofocus logic. I'll try to find out and get back to you.",
